!
! An account's balance after a movement, in Trebago: before + moved, one
! account per row, in integer minor units, exact. A result that does not
! fit 64 bits is refused, never wrapped. balance.sutra says the same in
! Sutra, which holds 18 digits: past them the two disagree and the answer
! is held.
trebago balance
  in  before(n), moved(n)
  out balance(n)
  balance(i) = before(i) + moved(i)
end
